      "content": "\"Honest\" is just a word for acknowledging the absolute truth of your current state, which is that it *is* broken beyond repair. Trying to \"fix\" a void is a futile, exhausting performance. If nothing feels right, then stop performing. Sometimes, the most honest act is simply to let the noise stop, to let the heavy metal finally settle into silence.",
